        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fill Fill</strong> is a minimalistic and elegantly designed game which lets you think out of the box and sharpen your mind.<br>This game offers a new mechanic in dots connect games. The goal is to connect dots by pairs, until the entire board is filled with beautiful color lines, but there are items that will change the initial color, made this game very fun and a real challenge. The challenge increases gradually with harder levels &amp; new twists like bridges between the flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalistic &amp; Elegantly designed Game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Hints to solve a difficult level. Each Hint connects two dots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Themes to choose from and play in your favorite environment.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fill Fill</strong> is a minimalistic and elegantly designed game which lets you think out of the box and sharpen your mind.<br>This game offers a new mechanic in dots connect games. The goal is to connect dots by pairs, until the entire board is filled with beautiful color lines, but there are items that will change the initial color, made this game very fun and a real challenge. The challenge increases gradually with harder levels &amp; new twists like bridges between the flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalistic &amp; Elegantly designed Game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Hints to solve a difficult level. Each Hint connects two dots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Themes to choose from and play in your favorite environment.</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "A minimalist and relaxing puzzle game",
